ng/150px-Equipment_icon-1524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/Equipment_icon-1524.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B\" title=\"另一个故事\">另一个故事</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>记忆者每使用2阶、3阶咒语后，分别使自身伤害提升<span class=\"color-value\">1%</span>、<span class=\"color-value\">2%</span>，该效果最多累计提升至<span class=\"color-value\">8%</span>；己方回合内，当记忆者累计消耗2点及以上灵光时，术法威力提升<span class=\"color-value\">10%</span>，效果持续至回合结束</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 0级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3097\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"阿尔古斯\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF%E5%B0%94%E5%8F%A4%E6%96%AF\" title=\"阿尔古斯\"><img alt=\"阿尔古斯\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-309701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%98%BF